    "detailed_description": "<strong>Open your dream restaurant!</strong><br><br>Enter the world of elite gastronomy and manage your own restaurant from A to Z: hospitality, cooking, waitering, you do it all! Learn from the best chefs in the world, prepare the most delicious meals to make your customers happy and become a true cooking star.<br><br><strong>Experience a complete culinary adventure</strong><br>Take care of your customers every step of the way: give them a warm welcome, take their orders and complete mini-games to prepare their favorite dishes. Every satisfied customer helps improving your reputation and giving you access to additionnal space for your restaurant and new cooking styles!<br><br><strong>Learn from the best</strong><br>As you make progress in your cooking journey, famous chefs from all over the world will join your restaurant to share their secrets: follow their advice and master dozens of tasty recipes inspired from French, American, Indian, Italian and Japanese specialties! <br><br><br>- Move freely around your restaurant and decide how to meet your customers\u2019 expectations<br><br>- Customise your chef to match your style: boy or girl, hair and skin colour...<br><br>- Prepare dozens of delicious recipes all by yourself: peel, slice, stir\u2026 Every dish is homemade in your restaurant!<br><br>- Master 5 different cooking styles, 30 recipes and become the ultimate chef",
